REM RedLilyGO - Autorun system test (M5-Atom-S3 class). Needs the Windows Agent running. Authorized testing only.
WHILE (AGENT_CONNECTED() == FALSE)
  DELAY 2000
END_WHILE
AGENT_RUN dir
WAIT_FOR_AGENT_RUN_RESULT
GUI
DELAY 1000
STRING https://github.com/zis3c/RedLilyGO/blob/main/docs/images/interface-status.png
ENTER
LED_R
WAIT_FOR_BUTTON_PRESS
LED_G
WAIT_FOR_BUTTON_PRESS
LED_B
WAIT_FOR_BUTTON_PRESS
LED_OFF
WIFI_OFF
ESP32M attack -t rickroll
WAIT_FOR_BUTTON_PRESS
DELAY 5000
RESET
